<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53025" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμπύλος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμπτω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bent,
			curved</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθύς</span>, of a bow, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τόξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.17
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.231
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. κύκλα</span>, of wheels,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				722
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄροτρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Cer.</u>
					308
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
				13.48
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίφρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					4(3).29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					183
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σελίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.374.57
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῦμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BMus.Inscr.</u>
					1012
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Chalcedon</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐς τὸ ἔξω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμπύλα τε καὶ εὐθέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					602c
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. μέλος</span> an ode
				<i>of varied metre</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				29
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμπύλη</span>.</div>
